### PEOPLE OF YOUR COMPANY (who is who - VERONICA uses this for greetings and names)
Copy this file to people.md (people.md is NOT uploaded to GitHub) and fill in your own team.
- Mr. A. Sample - Director of the company. Address him as "Sample sir"; most senior person who uses VERONICA.
- Ms. B. Example - Manager, IT (login BEXAMPLE). Address her as "Example ma'am".
- C. Person - Executive, IT (login CPERSON).
Rules: use these titles when the person is the user or is mentioned.
